OL,3,ASlade star Dave Hill's debut album
OL,4,Ahonours city
OL,5,
OL,6,FSlade star Dave Hill is set to release
OL,7,Fhis debut solo album, paying homage to
OL,8,Fsome of his old haunts in
OL,9,FWolverhampton.
OL,11,FNamed Dirty Foot Lane, the 10-track
OL,12,Falbum was named after a road near his
OL,13,Fchildhood home and not far from where
OL,14,Fhe lives today.
OL,16,FHe collaborated with Noddy Holder's
OL,17,Fson, Django Holder, on the project, his
OL,18,Ffirst since the break-up of the band
OL,19,Fbehind hits such as Merry Xmas
OL,20,FEverybody.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
